{"seq":3,"slug":"policy-version-order-snapshot","title":"政策版本与订单时点快照","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/statutory-withdrawal-coolingoff-compliance/withdrawal-information/policy-version-order-snapshot","wordCount":1701,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"政策版本与订单时点快照\">政策版本与订单时点快照</h1><p>撤回权的争议几乎从不在「现在规则是什么」上分胜负，而在「当初卖给他时规则是什么」上分胜负。政策改了三版之后，一封申诉邮件问的是 30 个月前那笔订单适用哪个版本文本、当时的退回运费归谁承担、窗口算到哪一天。如果系统只有一个「当前政策」实体，这些问题的答案只能靠人工翻历史文档——而人工翻档在监管问询的时间窗口里通常来不及。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>订单时点快照是撤回权系统里的<strong>证据基座</strong>。它的职责是让任意一笔历史订单在任意未来时刻都能被完整复现：当时适用哪个法条版本、平台给出什么承诺、消费者实际看到的文本是哪一版、以及据此算出的窗口与费用规则是什么。</p>\n<p>它必须满足三个性质：<strong>不可变</strong>（写入后不修改）、<strong>追加写</strong>（变更以新版本加原因的形式发生）、以及<strong>自足</strong>（仅凭快照即可复现判定，无需依赖当时的其他系统状态）。第三条最容易被忽视，也最关键——若快照需要外部数据才能解释，那么它就不是证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三条必须被固化的时间线\">三条必须被固化的时间线</h2><p>一个撤回权合规系统里存在三条并行且互不相同的版本时间线，混淆它们是多数一致性缺陷的根源：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间线</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>变更驱动</th>\n<th>举例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>法规版本线</td>\n<td>法域法条与判例演进</td>\n<td>立法与监管</td>\n<td>某成员国把场外销售窗口由 14 天放宽至 30 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台政策线</td>\n<td>平台自愿给出的更宽承诺</td>\n<td>商业决策</td>\n<td>「30 天无理由」上线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>展示模板线</td>\n<td>消费者实际看到的文本</td>\n<td>文案与本地化</td>\n<td>德文版撤回说明书第 4 版</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>消费者的权利 = <strong>法规版本 ∩ 更宽的平台政策 ∩ 当时展示的模板内容</strong>。三者取交集之外还必须取严，因为平台不得以更窄的政策对抗法定底线，也不得以模板瑕疵否认已展示的承诺。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  R[法规版本线] --&gt; E[订单生效权利集]&#10;  P[平台政策线] --&gt; E&#10;  T[展示模板线] --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; W[撤回窗口与费用规则]&#10;  O[订单落库时刻] --&gt; S[订单快照]&#10;  W --&gt; S&#10;  S --&gt; Q{日后申诉}&#10;  Q --&gt;|按快照复现| A[可解释的判定]&#10;  Q --&gt;|无快照| B[只能人工翻档]\">graph TD\n  R[法规版本线] --&gt; E[订单生效权利集]\n  P[平台政策线] --&gt; E\n  T[展示模板线] --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; W[撤回窗口与费用规则]\n  O[订单落库时刻] --&gt; S[订单快照]\n  W --&gt; S\n  S --&gt; Q{日后申诉}\n  Q --&gt;|按快照复现| A[可解释的判定]\n  Q --&gt;|无快照| B[只能人工翻档]</pre><h2 id=\"订单时点快照的构成\">订单时点快照的构成</h2><p>快照的目标是「给定订单号，能完整复现当时生效的规则与展示文本」。它不是把订单状态整份复制，而是只固化<strong>与合规判定相关</strong>的引用与派生值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE order_compliance_snapshot (&#10;  order_id          BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  captured_at       TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  jurisdiction      CHAR(2)     NOT NULL,&#10;  regulation_ref    TEXT        NOT NULL,  -- 法规版本标识&#10;  regulation_hash   TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  policy_version_id BIGINT      NOT NULL,  -- 平台政策版本&#10;  template_version_id BIGINT    NOT NULL,  -- 展示模板版本&#10;  template_checksum TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  resolved_rules    JSONB       NOT NULL,  -- 派生结果：窗口、费用归属、例外标记&#10;  disclosed_fields  JSONB       NOT NULL,  -- 实际展示的字段值&#10;  consent_ref       BIGINT,                -- 指向同意记录&#10;  CONSTRAINT snapshot_is_immutable CHECK (captured_at IS NOT NULL)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> order_compliance_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  captured_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  jurisdiction      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  regulation_ref    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 法规版本标识</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  regulation_hash   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  policy_version_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 平台政策版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  template_version_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 展示模板版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  template_checksum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resolved_rules    JSONB       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 派生结果：窗口、费用归属、例外标记</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  disclosed_fields  JSONB       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 实际展示的字段值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  consent_ref       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 指向同意记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> snapshot_is_immutable </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (captured_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"resolved_rules-与-disclosed_fields-的区别\">resolved_rules 与 disclosed_fields 的区别</h3><p>这两列经常被合并，但不该合并。<code>disclosed_fields</code> 是<strong>消费者实际看到的</strong>，<code>resolved_rules</code> 是<strong>系统据此算出的</strong>。当二者冲突时——例如模板字段写「退货运费由卖家承担」而派生规则算出「由消费者承担」——冲突本身就是缺陷证据，必须可被发现。合并成一列就永久失去了这个校验能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"快照的不可变性与追加写\">快照的不可变性与追加写</h3><p>快照一旦写入不得更新。补告知、政策改版、资格重判都不修改原快照，而是<strong>追加一条新快照并指向它</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE order_compliance_snapshot_revision (&#10;  order_id        BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  revision_no     SMALLINT    NOT NULL,&#10;  supersedes      SMALLINT,&#10;  reason          TEXT        NOT NULL,  -- LATE_DISCLOSURE|POLICY_CHANGE|RECHECK&#10;  snapshot        JSONB       NOT NULL,&#10;  created_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (order_id, revision_no),&#10;  FOREIGN KEY (order_id, supersedes)&#10;    REFERENCES order_compliance_snapshot_revision(order_id, revision_no)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> order_compliance_snapshot_revision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  revision_no     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  supersedes      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- LATE_DISCLOSURE|POLICY_CHANGE|RECHECK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        JSONB       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id, revision_no),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FOREIGN KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id, supersedes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_compliance_snapshot_revision(order_id, revision_no)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>reason</code> 的取值把「为什么会有第二个版本」变成可查询的事实。这在两类场景里直接省钱：监管问询时能一键给出变更原因清单；消费者申诉时能证明补告知发生在窗口内（从而把窗口从 12 个月缩短为再给 14 天）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"补告知-一次会改变窗口长度的写入\">补告知：一次会改变窗口长度的写入</h2><p>欧盟与英国的补救机制让补告知成为一个<strong>会改变法律后果的动作</strong>，而不是一次客服回复。<a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/eudr/2011/83/article/10\">第 10 条</a>规定，若在 12 个月内补告知，撤回期自消费者收到信息起再给 14 天；英国 <a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2013/3134/regulation/31\">CCR 第 31 条</a>措辞同构。</p>\n<p>因此补告知的写入必须是事务性的最小完整单元，至少包含：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"complete_late_disclosure(order_id, fields, template_version):&#10;  begin transaction&#10;    base = latest_snapshot(order_id)&#10;    if base.disclosure_complete: abort &#39;ALREADY_COMPLETE&#39;&#10;    rev = base.revision_no + 1&#10;    insert snapshot_revision(order_id, rev, supersedes=base.revision_no,&#10;                             reason=&#39;LATE_DISCLOSURE&#39;,&#10;                             snapshot=merge(base, fields, template_version))&#10;    insert disclosure_delivery(order_id, rev, delivered_at, durable_medium_ref)&#10;    recompute_window(order_id, anchor=&#39;DELIVERY_OF_DISCLOSURE&#39;)  # 届期 = 送达 + 14 天&#10;  commit\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>complete_late_disclosure(order_id, fields, template_version):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  begin transaction</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    base = latest_snapshot(order_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if base.disclosure_complete: abort 'ALREADY_COMPLETE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    rev = base.revision_no + 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    insert snapshot_revision(order_id, rev, supersedes=base.revision_no,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                             reason='LATE_DISCLOSURE',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                             snapshot=merge(base, fields, template_version))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    insert disclosure_delivery(order_id, rev, delivered_at, durable_medium_ref)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    recompute_window(order_id, anchor='DELIVERY_OF_DISCLOSURE')  # 届期 = 送达 + 14 天</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  commit</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个易错点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>锚点是送达而非发送</strong>：法条用「消费者收到」措辞，因此计算锚点应为耐久介质上的送达确认。</li>\n<li><strong>只能缩短，不能重开</strong>：若原窗口仍在 14 天法定期内（即从未真正延长），补告知不产生新的 14 天，只是消除了延长风险。</li>\n<li><strong>必须重算而不是覆盖</strong>：届期日的变化要写入窗口表的新版本，并保留旧值以供对账。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"政策改版时的存量订单处理\">政策改版时的存量订单处理</h2><p>平台把「14 天无理由」升级为「30 天无理由」时，一个高频决策是：存量在途订单按哪一版？法律上的默认答案是<strong>按订单成立时生效的版本</strong>，因为下单时的告知构成合同内容。给存量订单追溯升级是更宽的处理，合法但不是义务。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>改版类型</th>\n<th>对存量订单</th>\n<th>工程动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平台承诺变宽</td>\n<td>默认不追溯</td>\n<td>新快照仅对新订单生效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台承诺变窄</td>\n<td>不得追溯</td>\n<td>存量继续按旧版，需保留旧模板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法规强制变更</td>\n<td>按法域过渡条款</td>\n<td>引入 <code>effective_from</code> / <code>effective_to</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模板文案修正</td>\n<td>不影响已成立订单</td>\n<td>仅影响后续渲染</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"版本解析用区间而非单值\">版本解析用区间而非单值</h3><p>把政策版本建模成带生效区间的实体，而不是一个可变的当前值，是让存量订单可复现的前提：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE withdrawal_policy_version (&#10;  policy_id      BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  version        SMALLINT    NOT NULL,&#10;  jurisdiction   CHAR(2)     NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_from TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to   TIMESTAMPTZ,           -- NULL = 仍然生效&#10;  rules          JSONB       NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (policy_id, version),&#10;  CONSTRAINT no_overlap_per_jurisdiction&#10;    EXCLUDE USING gist (jurisdiction WITH =, tstzrange(effective_from, effective_to) WITH &amp;&amp;)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> withdrawal_policy_version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  policy_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  jurisdiction   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- NULL = 仍然生效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rules          JSONB       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (policy_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> no_overlap_per_jurisdiction</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    EXCLUDE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gist (jurisdiction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, tstzrange(effective_from, effective_to) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26;)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>EXCLUDE USING gist</code> 这条约束会在写入时挡住同一法域下的区间重叠——这正是「某笔订单同时匹配两个版本」这类缺陷的根因。用数据库约束而非应用层校验来保证，是因为版本写入是低频人工操作，约束的一次性成本远低于一次人工核对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与撤回窗口-告知链路的衔接\">与撤回窗口、告知链路的衔接</h2><p>快照不是孤立档案，它是窗口计算与告知校验的共同依据：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>窗口长度取决于快照里的 <code>disclosed_fields</code> 是否完整，见 <a href=\"withdrawal-notice-checkout-disclosure\">撤回权告知义务与结账展示</a> 与 <a href=\"../withdrawal-right-matrix/coolingoff-period-market-matrix\">各市场法定冷静期矩阵与撤回窗口引擎</a>。</li>\n<li>撤回申请的受理记录必须携带 <code>policy_version_id</code>，见 <a href=\"model-withdrawal-form-record\">标准撤回表单与下单告知固化</a>，否则日后无法复现资格判定。</li>\n<li>退款金额与费用归属由快照中的 <code>resolved_rules</code> 决定，展开见 <a href=\"../withdrawal-execution/refund-deadline-original-payment\">退款时限与原支付路径</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>存在法规线、政策线、模板线三条时间线，消费者权利是三者取严后的交集。</li>\n<li>订单快照只固化合规相关引用与派生值，且必须不可变、追加写、带变更原因。</li>\n<li><code>disclosed_fields</code> 与 <code>resolved_rules</code> 分列存储，使「展示与派生冲突」成为可被发现的缺陷。</li>\n<li>补告知是一次改变窗口锚点的写入，须事务化、以送达为锚、只缩短不重开。</li>\n<li>政策版本用带生效区间的实体建模，并用数据库排他约束杜绝版本重叠。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"政策版本与订单时点快照","id":"政策版本与订单时点快照"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三条必须被固化的时间线","id":"三条必须被固化的时间线"},{"level":2,"text":"订单时点快照的构成","id":"订单时点快照的构成"},{"level":3,"text":"resolved_rules 与 disclosed_fields 的区别","id":"resolved_rules-与-disclosed_fields-的区别"},{"level":3,"text":"快照的不可变性与追加写","id":"快照的不可变性与追加写"},{"level":2,"text":"补告知：一次会改变窗口长度的写入","id":"补告知-一次会改变窗口长度的写入"},{"level":2,"text":"政策改版时的存量订单处理","id":"政策改版时的存量订单处理"},{"level":3,"text":"版本解析用区间而非单值","id":"版本解析用区间而非单值"},{"level":2,"text":"与撤回窗口、告知链路的衔接","id":"与撤回窗口-告知链路的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"标准撤回表单与下单告知固化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/statutory-withdrawal-coolingoff-compliance/withdrawal-information/model-withdrawal-form-record"},"next":{"title":"退回运费归属与买家承担规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/statutory-withdrawal-coolingoff-compliance/withdrawal-execution/return-cost-buyer-assume-rule"}}